Box 50986, seat 182602 (after 0085): the day's question was handed on at
12:07:25 — to the queue's first pick, the contact saved as „💙". The
section rightly refuses to ask about a label with no letter, so the reply
asked nothing, and the day was spent; the named neighbour behind it never
came up. The day's path now looks through the queue's first five and hands
on the first contact with a readable name; none, and nothing is spent.

